01:33.301 --> 01:34.552
♪ And quite a treat ♪
♪ 真是一种享受 ♪

01:34.636 --> 01:37.347
♪ And, oh, I love
they way they smell ♪
♪ 而且，哦，我爱
他们的气味 ♪

01:37.430 --> 01:38.348
