♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:39.432 --> 01:40.350
♪ La-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:40.433 --> 01:41.768
♪ La-la-la-la... ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦……♪

01:41.851 --> 01:43.603
I know I shouldn't have
gotten out of bed today.
我知道我不应该
今天起床了。

01:43.686 --> 01:46.064
♪ La... la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦...啦啦啦啦 ♪

01:56.449 --> 01:57.951
Hello...
你好...

01:58.034 --> 02:02.080
and welcome one and all your
money to ye old Krusty Krabby.
并欢迎您的一位和所有
钱给你们老库斯蒂·克拉比。

02:02.163 --> 02:03.289
Come along, sisters.
姐妹们快来吧。

02:03.373 --> 02:07.252
Pay not mind to this
crimson abomination.
不用在意这个
深红色的憎恶。

02:07.335 --> 02:08.294
Ahh...
啊...

02:08.378 --> 02:09.629
Greetings.
问候。

02:09.712 --> 02:12.340
Although your
establishment
seems repugnant
虽然你的
设立
似乎令人反感

02:12.423 --> 02:14.050
and foul in nature,
且性质恶劣，

02:14.133 --> 02:16.803
it seems not to offend
our sensitivities.
似乎并没有冒犯
我们的敏感性。

02:16.886 --> 02:18.888
It is for that reason
plus the fact that
正是因为这个原因
再加上事实

02:18.972 --> 02:21.766
we have been stuck on a tour bus
for several days
我们被困在旅游巴士上
好几天

02:21.850 --> 02:25.979
that my sisters and I would
like to eat something here.
我和我的姐妹们会
喜欢在这里吃东西。

02:26.062 --> 02:27.981
OK, but first let me
call the mortician
好的，但首先让我
打电话给殡仪师

02:28.064 --> 02:31.150
and tell him his
uniform's been stolen.
并告诉他他的
制服被偷了。

02:34.362 --> 02:35.488
Clothing zinger.
服装劲爆。

02:35.572 --> 02:37.532
Squidward,
these wretched hags...
章鱼哥，
这些可恶的女巫……

02:37.615 --> 02:39.826
Uh... Lovely ladies
呃……可爱的女士们

02:39.909 --> 02:41.494
are obviously here to eat.
显然是来吃饭的。

02:41.578 --> 02:42.996
So let's sell 'em...
所以我们把它们卖掉吧...

02:43.079 --> 02:47.167
Uh, I mean, serve them some
delicious Krabby Patties.
呃，我的意思是，给他们提供一些
美味的蟹肉饼。

02:47.250 --> 02:49.210
Well, Mr. uh...
嗯，呃先生...

02:49.294 --> 02:50.461
Krabs, m'lady.
螃蟹，女士。

02:50.545 --> 02:51.671
Mr. "Grabs".
“抢”先生。

02:51.754 --> 02:53.506
You seem to know the basic rules
你似乎知道基本规则

02:53.590 --> 02:56.509
of behaving like
a civilized bottom feeder.
表现得像
文明的底层喂食者。

02:56.593 --> 02:58.595
Perhaps your
restaurant isn't quite
也许你的
餐厅不太好

02:58.678 --> 03:01.389
the hive of degenerates
it appears to be
堕落者的巢穴
看来是

03:01.472 --> 03:04.183
and we had you
figured all wrong.
我们有你
都想错了。

03:04.267 --> 03:05.310
Course you did.
当然你做到了。

03:05.393 --> 03:06.311
As you're about to find out.
正如你即将发现的那样。

03:06.394 --> 03:07.353
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

03:07.437 --> 03:10.356
Ahh...
啊...

03:13.276 --> 03:15.361
Ahh...
啊...

03:15.445 --> 03:16.613
Ahh...
啊...

03:16.696 --> 03:18.323
♪ I like Krabby Patties ♪
♪ 我喜欢蟹黄饼 ♪

03:18.406 --> 03:19.449
♪ I think they're swell ♪
♪ 我觉得他们很膨胀 ♪

03:19.532 --> 03:20.658
♪ I like Krabby Patties ♪
♪ 我喜欢蟹黄饼 ♪

03:20.742 --> 03:21.993
♪ Can you not tell? ♪
♪ 你能说不出来吗？ ♪

03:22.076 --> 03:23.536
♪ Krabby Patties,
Krabby Patties ♪
♪ 蟹肉饼，
蟹肉饼♪

03:23.620 --> 03:24.704
♪ They're so neat ♪
♪ 它们真整齐 ♪

03:24.787 --> 03:25.747
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

03:25.830 --> 03:27.373
♪ Sweet to eat ♪
♪ 吃起来甜甜的 ♪

03:27.457 --> 03:28.583
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

03:28.666 --> 03:29.584
♪ Really neat ♪
♪ 真的很整洁 ♪

03:29.667 --> 03:30.877
♪ Sweet to eat ♪
♪ 吃起来甜甜的 ♪

03:30.960 --> 03:32.337
♪ Treat that's neat ♪
♪ 对待它很整洁 ♪

03:32.420 --> 03:33.713
♪ Sweet treat ♪
♪ 甜点 ♪

03:33.796 --> 03:34.881
♪ Treat, sweet, treat, sweet ♪
♪ 款待，甜蜜，款待，甜蜜 ♪

03:34.964 --> 03:36.382
♪ Hickory, trick or treat ♪
♪ 山核桃木，不给糖就捣蛋 ♪

03:36.466 --> 03:37.634
♪ Doo, doo, doo, doo ♪
♪ 嘟、嘟、嘟、嘟 ♪

03:37.717 --> 03:38.885
♪ Ra-ta-ta-ta,
ta-ta-ta-ta ♪
♪ 拉塔塔塔，
塔塔塔塔♪

03:38.968 --> 03:40.345
♪ Ta-ta-ta-ta,
ta-ta-ta-ta ♪
♪ 塔塔塔塔塔，
塔塔塔塔♪

03:40.428 --> 03:41.471
♪ Ta-ta-ta-ta-doo ♪
♪ 塔塔塔塔杜 ♪

03:41.554 --> 03:42.680
♪ Ra-ta-doo, ra-ta-doo ♪
♪ 拉-塔-杜，拉-塔-杜 ♪

03:42.764 --> 03:44.223
♪ Ra... dah ♪
♪ 拉...达 ♪

03:44.307 --> 03:45.391
♪ La, la, la, la ♪
♪ 啦，啦，啦，啦 ♪

03:45.475 --> 03:46.559
♪ La... ♪
♪ 啦... ♪

03:46.643 --> 03:49.103
♪ La, la,
la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦，啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

03:49.187 --> 03:50.730
Sss...
嘶……

03:59.489 --> 04:02.241
Look at this wild hooligan
看看这个狂野的流氓

04:02.325 --> 04:03.368
running amok.
胡作非为。

04:03.451 --> 04:05.036
Singing, dancing.
唱歌、跳舞。

04:05.119 --> 04:08.623
It's... It's shameless
and disgusting.
这……真是无耻啊
和恶心。

04:08.706 --> 04:11.376
Avert your eyes.
移开你的目光。

04:11.459 --> 04:12.710
Young man...
年轻人...

04:12.794 --> 04:15.421
what has caused you
to act like this?
是什么导致了你
这样做？

04:15.505 --> 04:16.506
I must know.
我必须知道。

04:16.589 --> 04:17.966
Actually ma'am...
其实女士...

04:18.049 --> 04:21.344
was the absolute fun and
deliciousness of a Krabby Patty.
绝对有趣而且
蟹肉饼的美味。

04:21.427 --> 04:22.428
Krabby Patty?
克拉比·帕蒂？

04:22.512 --> 04:23.888
Yeah,
that's right.
是的，
没错。

04:23.972 --> 04:27.892
Well, anything this fun and
delicious can't be good.
好吧，任何如此有趣和
美味不可能是好的。

04:27.976 --> 04:29.560
Why, what would this world be
为什么，这个世界会是什么样子

04:29.644 --> 04:32.063
if everyone cavorted
in such a manner?
如果每个人都欢闹
以这样的方式？

04:32.146 --> 04:33.773
Who are you
with your tight lips
你是谁
用你紧闭的嘴唇

04:33.856 --> 04:36.609
raised eyebrows
and conservative clothes?
扬起眉毛
和保守的衣服？

04:36.693 --> 04:39.112
I am Miss Gretel Puss.
我是格蕾特·普斯小姐。

04:39.195 --> 04:41.197
We are The United
Organization of Fish
我们是联合
鱼的组织

04:41.281 --> 04:44.409
Against Things That
Are Fun And Delicious.
反对那些事
既有趣又美味。

04:44.492 --> 04:47.120
Or TU-O-FATTAFAD for short.
或简称 TU-O-FATTAFAD。

04:47.203 --> 04:51.624
And we are going to ban
these so-called Krabby Patties
我们将禁止
这些所谓的蟹肉饼

04:51.708 --> 04:54.460
and close your
restaurant forever.
并关闭你的
永远的餐厅。

04:54.544 --> 04:55.461
What the...
什么...

04:55.545 --> 04:57.046
Miss "Gristle" Puss?
“软骨”猫小姐？

04:57.130 --> 04:59.674
Maybe if you were to taste
the Krabby Patty for yourself
也许如果你想尝尝
为自己准备一份蟹肉饼

04:59.757 --> 05:02.885
you two could experience
the awesome pleasure.
你们两个可以体验
令人敬畏的快乐。

05:02.969 --> 05:07.306
I would soon as sprout legs
and do the Watusi.
我很快就会长出腿
并做瓦图西。

05:07.390 --> 05:08.474
Ooh, OK.
哦，好吧。

05:08.558 --> 05:10.435
Uh, it don't matter
anyway, lad.
呃，没关系
无论如何，小伙子。

05:10.518 --> 05:12.395
She can't close us down.
她不能让我们关闭。

05:12.478 --> 05:14.564
Krabs: She closed us down.
螃蟹：她关闭了我们。

05:14.647 --> 05:17.942
I'm ruined...
我毁了...

05:18.026 --> 05:19.861
How did it
come to this?
是怎么做到的
来到这个？

05:19.944 --> 05:22.113
You called Miss Gristle Puss
a disgusting, old prune
你叫格里斯托小姐为小猫
令人作呕的老李子

05:22.196 --> 05:24.157
then you threatened her
with a French fry strainer.
然后你威胁她
用炸薯条过滤器。

05:24.240 --> 05:27.285
Well, I didn't know her
husband was the chief of police.
嗯，我不认识她
丈夫是警察局长。

05:27.368 --> 05:28.661
Thanks again, Al.
再次感谢，阿尔。

05:28.745 --> 05:29.704
Anytime, honey.
任何时候，亲爱的。

05:29.787 --> 05:31.372
See you at home for dinner.
晚上回家见。

05:31.456 --> 05:33.499
Mm, I'm starving.
嗯，我饿了。

05:33.583 --> 05:35.626
Yee-haw.
呀呀。

05:35.710 --> 05:40.965
I just love that man.
我就是爱那个男人。

05:41.049 --> 05:43.176
How long has he
been standing over there?
他多久了
一直站在那儿吗？

05:43.259 --> 05:44.469
Um... Four days.
嗯……四天。

05:44.552 --> 05:45.470
It's no use.
这是没有用的。

05:45.553 --> 05:48.514
I'm ruined...
我毁了...

05:51.934 --> 05:53.186
You know, it's too bad.
你知道，这太糟糕了。

05:53.269 --> 05:55.396
The only way to make
Krabby Patties again
唯一的办法就是制作
又是蟹肉饼

05:55.480 --> 05:58.441
would be if you
opened a place that didn't
look like a restaurant
如果你会
开了一个没有的地方
看起来像一家餐馆

05:58.524 --> 06:00.485
and did it secretly.
并且是秘密进行的。

06:00.568 --> 06:01.527
That's it.
就是这样。

06:01.611 --> 06:03.196
A secret Krusty Krab.
秘制蟹堡王。

06:03.279 --> 06:08.951
And I know just
where to open it.
我知道只是
在哪里打开它。

06:09.035 --> 06:12.205
There you are, Betsy,
good as new.
你在这里，贝特西，
完好如新。

06:12.288 --> 06:13.539
Mmm...
嗯...

06:13.623 --> 06:14.582
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

06:14.665 --> 06:15.625
Whoa, sorry.
哇，抱歉。

06:15.708 --> 06:16.876
I was just wondering...
我只是想知道...

06:16.959 --> 06:18.544
You know, lad,
I can remember a time
你知道，小伙子，
我记得有一次

06:18.628 --> 06:21.506
when people used to knock before
entering someone else's home.
以前人们敲门的时候
进入别人家。

06:21.589 --> 06:22.507
Yeah, but this is my home.
是的，但这是我的家。

06:22.590 --> 06:23.508
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

06:23.591 --> 06:24.509
Hey, guys.
嘿，伙计们。

06:24.592 --> 06:25.551
Hey, Patrick.
嘿，帕特里克。

06:25.635 --> 06:26.552
Thanks for helping out today.
谢谢你今天帮忙。

06:26.636 --> 06:27.720
You bet.
你打赌。

06:27.804 --> 06:28.971
Where'd you want
these extras buns?
你想要去哪里
这些额外的面包？

06:29.055 --> 06:30.640
Patrick, that bag
is totally empty.
帕特里克，那个包
完全是空的。

06:30.723 --> 06:34.769
... Oops.
... 哎呀。

06:34.852 --> 06:36.312
Plankton: Happy day, Karen.
浮游生物：快乐的一天，凯伦。

06:36.395 --> 06:39.649
That fool, Krabs, changed
the name of his restaurant
蟹蟹那个傻瓜变了
他的餐厅的名字

06:39.732 --> 06:40.900
to "The Closed Krab".
到“封闭的螃蟹”。

06:40.983 --> 06:43.486
Everyone will
think it's closed
每个人都会
认为它已关闭

06:43.569 --> 06:45.071
and come eat here instead.
那就来这里吃饭吧。

06:45.154 --> 06:47.490
He'll be ruined by tomorrow.
明天他就会被毁掉。

06:47.573 --> 06:49.367
Heh-heh, what an idiot.
呵呵，真是个白痴啊。

06:49.450 --> 06:50.368
It is closed.
它已关闭。

06:50.451 --> 06:51.536
What?
什么？

06:51.619 --> 06:53.037
Miss Gristle Puss
and her husband
克里斯特尔猫小姐
和她的丈夫

06:53.121 --> 06:55.581
banned Krabby Patties
for being fun and delicious.
禁止蟹肉饼
因为有趣又美味。

06:55.665 --> 06:56.582
Banned?
被禁止？

06:56.666 --> 06:57.834
Then that means
那么这意味着

06:57.917 --> 07:01.212
my day of reckoning
has come at last.
我的清算日
终于来了。

07:01.295 --> 07:03.756
I've won, I tell you,
I've won.
我赢了，我告诉你，
我赢了。

07:03.840 --> 07:05.675
And what better way
than by default.
还有什么更好的方法
比默认情况下。

07:05.758 --> 07:06.801
Where are you going?
你要去哪里？

07:06.884 --> 07:09.011
Oh, out to celebrate.
哦，出去庆祝一下。

07:09.095 --> 07:12.598
Don't wait up for me.
别等我了

07:12.682 --> 07:13.808
Quit shoving.
别再推搡了。

07:13.891 --> 07:14.809
I wasn't shoving.
我没有推搡。

07:14.892 --> 07:16.018
I was just going like that
我就这样走了

07:16.102 --> 07:17.603
and you happened
to be standing there.
你发生了
站在那里。

07:17.687 --> 07:18.688
That's called shoving.
这就是所谓的推搡。

07:18.771 --> 07:19.689
No, it isn't.
不，不是。

07:19.772 --> 07:20.690
Yes, it is.
是的。

07:20.773 --> 07:21.816
Nope.
没有。

07:21.899 --> 07:23.776
Nope.
没有。

07:23.860 --> 07:25.361
But what's with
all the hullabaloo?
但有什么关系
所有的喧嚣？

07:25.444 --> 07:27.613
We're just waitin' in line
to buy a Krabby Patty.
我们只是在排队等待
买蟹肉饼。

07:27.697 --> 07:32.618
Krabby Patty?
克拉比·帕蒂？

07:32.702 --> 07:33.786
Thank you.
谢谢。

07:33.870 --> 07:37.331
Come again.
再来吧。

07:37.415 --> 07:41.460
Patrick: Can I help whoever
is next, please?
帕特里克：我可以帮助谁吗
请问是下一个吗？

07:42.837 --> 07:43.963
Patrick: What's the
password, please?
帕特里克：那是什么
请问密码？

07:44.046 --> 07:45.590
What are you talking about
你在说什么

07:45.673 --> 07:47.592
you gargantuan buffoon?
你这个大小丑？

07:47.675 --> 07:48.593
That's it.
就是这样。

07:48.676 --> 07:49.760
Come right in.
进来吧。

07:49.844 --> 07:50.761
Curse you.
诅咒你。

07:53.848 --> 07:55.558
Meow.
喵。

07:55.641 --> 08:00.521
So would you like to "secret"
size that for $2 more?
那么你想“秘密”吗？
尺寸要多 2 美元吗？

08:00.605 --> 08:01.606
Of course.
当然。

08:01.689 --> 08:03.065
Hey, "Squidwart"?
嘿，“鱿鱼疣”？

08:03.149 --> 08:05.610
You haven't seen any sign
of the... you know...
你还没有看到任何迹象
的...你知道...

08:05.693 --> 08:07.195
the cops, have you?
警察，你有吗？

08:07.278 --> 08:09.280
Did you just
call me "Squidwart"?
你刚刚是不是
请叫我“鱿鱼”？

08:09.363 --> 08:11.949
OK, thanks, I'm gonna go
see how SpongeBob's doing.
好的，谢谢，我这就去
看看海绵宝宝的表现如何。

08:12.033 --> 08:13.492
Hey, SpongeBob...
嘿，海绵宝宝...

08:13.576 --> 08:14.493
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

08:15.953 --> 08:17.663
Ohh...
哦...

08:17.747 --> 08:19.749
What are you doing
under the table?
你在做什么
在桌子底下？

08:19.832 --> 08:21.876
If Krabby Patties
are illegal now
如果蟹肉饼
现在是非法的

08:21.959 --> 08:23.669
aren't we breaking the law?
我们没有违法吗？

08:23.753 --> 08:25.004
There's an old saying, lad.
有句老话，小伙子。

08:25.087 --> 08:26.214
What doesn't kill you
什么杀不死你

08:26.297 --> 08:28.299
usually succeeds
in the second attempt.
通常会成功
在第二次尝试中。

08:28.382 --> 08:30.593
But what does that have to
do with making Krabby Patties?
但这有什么必要
做蟹黄馅饼吗？

08:30.676 --> 08:33.429
Nothing, but if you don't get
out there and start cooking
没什么，但如果你没有得到
在那里开始做饭

08:33.512 --> 08:36.849
I'll make you start
taking weekends off.
我会让你开始
周末休息。

08:36.933 --> 08:38.976
SpongeBob: No!
海绵宝宝：不！

08:39.060 --> 08:41.687
So Mr. Krabs is operating
所以蟹老板正在操作

08:41.771 --> 08:44.190
under the table, huh?
在桌子底下吧？

08:44.273 --> 08:48.694
Well, two can play at that game.
嗯，那个游戏可以两个人玩。

08:50.655 --> 08:54.659
Being a ruthless mastermind
sure takes a lot out of you.
成为无情的主谋
肯定会让你付出很多。

08:58.371 --> 09:00.957
Man: Hello, this is
Officer Al, Chief of Police
男：你好，这是
艾尔警官，警察局长

09:01.040 --> 09:02.792
Cops, I need you.
警察们，我需要你们。

09:06.837 --> 09:10.883
There.
那里。

09:16.639 --> 09:18.975
What's the pass...
通行证是什么...

09:19.058 --> 09:20.559
Nope, that's not it.
不，不是这样的。

09:38.119 --> 09:39.078
You missed one.
你错过了一个。

09:39.161 --> 09:40.746
Oh, Miss Gristle Puss.
哦，格里斯托猫小姐。

09:40.830 --> 09:42.999
I'm sorry we sold Krabby Patties
抱歉我们卖掉了蟹黄饼

09:43.082 --> 09:46.002
but do you really have
to send us to jail?
但你真的有吗
把我们送进监狱？

09:46.085 --> 09:47.211
Of course, I do.
当然，我愿意。

09:47.295 --> 09:49.755
You are a nuisance
to my community.
你真是个麻烦
到我的社区。

09:49.839 --> 09:50.965
You tell 'em, honey.
你告诉他们，亲爱的。

09:51.048 --> 09:53.968
Ha... That's my girl.
哈...那是我的女孩。

09:54.051 --> 09:55.845
: Al.
：阿尔。

09:55.928 --> 09:56.846
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

09:56.929 --> 09:58.014
Having some lunch.
吃点午饭。

09:58.097 --> 10:00.933
Unhand that
sandwich at once.
松开那个
立即三明治。

10:01.017 --> 10:02.685
Miss Gristle Puss, look out.
格里斯托猫小姐，小心。

10:02.768 --> 10:03.769
What?
什么？

10:03.853 --> 10:06.439
Your shoe's untied.
你的鞋带解开了。

10:06.522 --> 10:07.440
It is?
这是？

10:07.523 --> 10:09.775
Ohh...
哦...

10:09.859 --> 10:14.447
: Ohh...
: 哦...

10:22.872 --> 10:25.124
Ahh...
啊...

10:28.711 --> 10:30.921
Ahh...
啊...

10:31.005 --> 10:32.006
♪ I like Krabby Patties ♪
♪ 我喜欢蟹黄饼 ♪

10:32.089 --> 10:33.215
♪ I think they're swell ♪
♪ 我觉得他们很膨胀 ♪

10:33.299 --> 10:35.468
♪ Can you not tell? ♪
♪ 你能说不出来吗？ ♪

10:35.551 --> 10:37.011
♪ Krabby Patties,
Krabby Patties ♪
♪ 蟹肉饼，
蟹肉饼♪

10:37.094 --> 10:38.095
♪ They're so neat ♪
♪ 它们真整齐 ♪

10:38.179 --> 10:39.138
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

10:39.221 --> 10:40.473
♪ La-la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦 ♪

10:40.556 --> 10:43.142
♪ La-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la-la... ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦啦……♪

10:43.225 --> 10:45.644
Really neat, ha...
真的很整齐，哈...

10:45.728 --> 10:46.729
♪ Sweet to eat ♪
♪ 吃起来甜甜的 ♪

10:46.812 --> 10:48.064
♪ Treat that's neat ♪
♪ 对待它很整洁 ♪

10:48.147 --> 10:49.106
Both: ♪ Ra-ta-ta-ta,
ta-ta-ta-ta ♪
两者：♪ 拉塔塔塔，
塔塔塔塔♪

10:49.190 --> 10:50.107
♪ Ta-ta-ta-ta-doo ♪
♪ 塔塔塔塔杜 ♪

10:50.191 --> 10:52.777
... Blah.
... 废话。

10:52.860 --> 10:55.780
♪ And dismount. ♪
♪ 然后下马。 ♪

10:55.863 --> 10:57.656
That was wonderful.
那太棒了。

10:57.740 --> 11:00.785
I... I feel...
我……我感觉……

11:00.868 --> 11:02.244
reborn.
重生。

11:02.328 --> 11:04.663
Does this mean you're not
sending us to the slammer?
这是否意味着你不是
把我们送去监狱？

11:04.747 --> 11:05.873
Of course, my dear boy.
当然，我亲爱的孩子。

11:05.956 --> 11:09.043
I am a kinder, gentler fish
我是一条更善良、更温柔的鱼

11:09.126 --> 11:11.670
and I owe it all to you.
我把这一切都归功于你。

11:11.754 --> 11:12.838
Don't forget the spatula.
别忘了抹刀。

11:17.635 --> 11:18.803
Don't push it, Al.
别逼它，艾尔。

11:18.886 --> 11:20.262
Darn it.
该死的。

11:20.346 --> 11:21.389
Ahh.
啊。

11:21.472 --> 11:24.183
Once again,
so close and yet so far.
再一次，
如此接近，却又如此遥远。

11:24.266 --> 11:26.018
When am I gonna...
我什么时候才能...

11:26.102 --> 11:27.269
Ooh.
哦。

11:27.353 --> 11:30.689
Well, I think
I'll have another one.
嗯，我想
我再要一份。

11:32.566 --> 11:34.944
Oh, dear.
哦亲爱的。

11:35.027 --> 11:35.986
Plankton: Ahh!
浮游生物：啊！

11:53.045 --> 11:54.672
Hey...
嘿...

11:54.755 --> 11:57.258
Somebody left me a package.
有人给我留下了一个包裹。

11:59.135 --> 12:02.763
: Heavy.
： 重的。

12:03.722 --> 12:04.890
I wonder what's inside?
我想知道里面是什么？

12:04.974 --> 12:06.058
Hello.
你好。

12:10.020 --> 12:12.231
Whew... cramped in there.
呃……那里很拥挤。

12:12.314 --> 12:14.275
Cousin Stanley.
斯坦利表弟。

12:14.358 --> 12:15.776
Cousin SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝表弟。

12:15.860 --> 12:17.403
La-la-la-la...
啦啦啦啦……

12:17.486 --> 12:20.239
So what brings you
to Bikini Bottom, Stanley?
那么是什么给你带来
去比基尼泳裤吧，斯坦利？

12:20.322 --> 12:22.074
Uncle Sherm said
I should come visit you.
谢姆叔叔说
我应该来拜访你。

12:22.158 --> 12:24.785
I have a note from him
somewhere... Oh, right.
我有他的便条
某处...哦，对了。

12:24.869 --> 12:26.203
It's in here.
它就在这里。

12:28.330 --> 12:29.248
Here it is.
这里是。

12:29.331 --> 12:30.708
"Dear SpongeBob.
“亲爱的海绵宝宝。

12:30.791 --> 12:33.294
I'm sending your cousin Stanley
to live with you.
我要派你的表弟斯坦利来
和你住在一起。

12:33.377 --> 12:34.587
He can't hold down a job
他保不住工作

12:34.670 --> 12:37.256
and he ruins
everything he touches.
他毁了
他接触到的一切。

12:37.339 --> 12:38.507
I can't take it anymore.
我再也受不了了。

12:38.591 --> 12:40.301
Maybe you can
straighten him out.
也许你可以
把他摆正。

12:40.384 --> 12:41.594
Love, Uncle Sherm."
爱你，谢姆叔叔。”

12:41.677 --> 12:43.596
Well, you're always
welcome here Stanley.
嗯，你总是
欢迎来到斯坦利。

12:43.679 --> 12:46.474
My pineapple is your pineapple.
我的菠萝就是你的菠萝。

12:46.557 --> 12:48.601
Wow, you've got
your own refrigerator.
哇，你有
你自己的冰箱。

12:48.684 --> 12:52.062
I'm not allowed near the
'fridge at Uncle Sherm's.
我不被允许靠近
“谢姆叔叔家的冰箱。”

12:52.146 --> 12:55.232
Whoa...
哇...

12:55.316 --> 12:56.358
SpongeBob: Oh, well...
海绵宝宝：噢，好吧……

12:56.442 --> 12:58.402
Now I won't have
to clean it out.
现在我不会有
把它清理掉。

12:58.486 --> 13:00.029
Stanley: Wha-hoo-hoo-hoo.
斯坦利：哇-呼-呼-呼。

13:00.112 --> 13:03.157
Stanley?
斯坦利？

13:03.240 --> 13:04.450
You OK in there, Stanley?
你在里面还好吗，斯坦利？

13:04.533 --> 13:07.328
Your toilet is so cool.
你家厕所好酷啊

13:07.411 --> 13:09.038
Is that what I think it is?
是我想的那样吗？

13:15.127 --> 13:16.462
Well, it was bath night.
嗯，那是洗澡之夜。

13:16.545 --> 13:17.963
TV Announcer: Only $29.95.
电视播音员：仅需 29.95 美元。

13:18.047 --> 13:19.632
Gee, whee...
哎呀，哎呀...

13:19.715 --> 13:22.593
Uncle Sherm won't
let me watch TV back at home.
雪姆叔叔不会
让我回家看看电视。

13:22.676 --> 13:24.345
Why not?
为什么不呢？

13:24.428 --> 13:25.346
That's why.
这就是原因。

13:25.429 --> 13:26.805
What's that?
那是什么？

13:26.889 --> 13:28.474
Oh, that's OK.
哦，没关系。

13:28.557 --> 13:31.018
There's nothing
good on TV anyway.
什么都没有
无论如何，电视上都很好。

13:31.101 --> 13:32.228
Nothing.
没有什么。

13:32.311 --> 13:34.104
You work at the Krusty Krab?
你在蟹堡王工作吗？

13:34.188 --> 13:35.356
I don't just work there.
我不只是在那里工作。

13:35.439 --> 13:37.358
I'm vice-assistant,
general manager
我是副助理
总经理

13:37.441 --> 13:39.652
in charge of certain things.
负责某些事情。

13:39.735 --> 13:41.320
That's me turning
the front door key.
那是我转身
前门钥匙。

13:41.403 --> 13:42.738
That's me serving customers.
这就是我为顾客服务的情况。

13:42.821 --> 13:46.283
And that's me performing
sanitary maintenance.
这就是我表演的
卫生维护。

13:46.367 --> 13:47.701
Ooh, who's that?
哦，那是谁？

13:47.785 --> 13:50.246
Oh, that... That's me
making Krabby Patties.
噢，那个……那是我
制作蟹黄饼。

13:50.329 --> 13:51.372
The best job in the world.
世界上最好的工作。

13:51.455 --> 13:52.373
It's my calling.
这是我的召唤。

13:52.456 --> 13:54.124
I wish I had a calling.
我希望我有一个电话。

13:54.208 --> 13:55.834
Aw, Stanley...
噢，斯坦利……

13:55.918 --> 13:59.338
You just haven't found your
purpose in life, that's all.
你只是还没有找到你的
人生目标，仅此而已。

13:59.421 --> 14:00.839
You really think so?
你真的这么认为吗？

14:00.923 --> 14:02.132
I know so.
我知道是这样。

14:02.216 --> 14:06.512
I'll bet my friend,
Squidward, can help you.
我敢打赌我的朋友
乌贼，可以帮助你。

14:06.595 --> 14:07.805
Hi, Squidward.
嗨，章鱼哥。

14:07.888 --> 14:10.266
I'd like you to meet
my cousin Stanley.
我想让你认识一下
我的表弟斯坦利。

14:10.349 --> 14:11.684
We're related.
我们有关系。

14:11.767 --> 14:13.978
Squidward: There's two of them?
章鱼哥：有两个？

14:23.237 --> 14:25.656
Step on it.
踩它。

14:25.739 --> 14:27.366
Your friend, Squidward,
seems busy.
你的朋友，章鱼哥，
看起来很忙。

14:27.449 --> 14:28.534
No, that's OK.
不，没关系。

14:28.617 --> 14:30.578
I'm sure Sandy
can think of something.
我确信桑迪
能想到一些东西。

14:30.661 --> 14:32.538
Sandy: Hey, SpongeBob..
桑迪：嘿，海绵宝宝..

14:32.621 --> 14:33.747
who's your friend?
谁是你的朋友？

14:33.831 --> 14:35.708
This is my cousin,
Stanley SquarePants.
这是我的表弟，
斯坦利方裤。

14:35.791 --> 14:38.043
I thought you could show him
how to be a scientist.
我以为你可以给他看
如何成为一名科学家。

14:38.127 --> 14:39.044
Why, sure.
为什么，当然。

14:39.128 --> 14:40.379
Glad to meet you, partner.
很高兴认识你，伙伴。

14:40.462 --> 14:41.380
Nice to meet you...
很高兴见到你...

14:41.463 --> 14:44.300
Uh...
呃...

14:50.389 --> 14:52.141
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

14:52.224 --> 14:54.310
Y'all darn it...
你们都该死...

14:54.393 --> 14:58.147
Uh... Maybe you're just
not scientist material.
呃...也许你只是
不是科学家材料。

14:58.230 --> 14:59.356
But don't you worry.
但你不用担心。

14:59.440 --> 15:01.066
I'll bet Patrick
can help ya.
我敢打赌帕特里克
可以帮助你。

15:01.150 --> 15:02.568
He's a genius.
他是个天才。

15:02.651 --> 15:05.738
SpongeBob: And so Mr. Star,
that's why we came to you.
海绵宝宝：所以星星先生，
这就是我们来找你的原因。

15:05.821 --> 15:09.074
Looking for
your calling, huh?
寻找
你的电话，是吗？

15:09.158 --> 15:10.075
Hmm...
唔...

15:10.159 --> 15:12.369
Um-hm.
嗯嗯。

15:12.453 --> 15:14.246
Um-hm.
嗯嗯。

15:14.330 --> 15:17.374
So what are you good at?
那么你擅长什么？

15:17.458 --> 15:18.542
Nothing.
没有什么。

15:18.626 --> 15:20.294
Nothing at all?
什么都没有？

15:20.377 --> 15:21.337
Yup.
是的。

15:21.420 --> 15:22.671
Interesting.
有趣的。

15:22.755 --> 15:26.175
Let's see how
good you are at nothing.
让我们看看如何
很好，你一无是处。

15:26.258 --> 15:27.926
That's perfect.
那很完美。

15:28.010 --> 15:29.928
Patrick can do nothing
better than anyone.
帕特里克无能为力
比任何人都好。

15:30.012 --> 15:32.931
You'll be learning
from the master.
你将会学习到
来自大师。

15:33.015 --> 15:34.683
Come with me.
跟我来吧。

15:34.767 --> 15:39.146
First sit down in this chair.
首先坐在这把椅子上。

15:39.229 --> 15:40.689
Clear your mind.
清理你的头脑。

15:40.773 --> 15:44.151
Empty it of all thoughts
清空一切思绪

15:44.234 --> 15:45.778
until you're doing
直到你在做

15:45.861 --> 15:51.283
absolutely...
绝对地...

15:51.367 --> 15:53.285
nothing.
没有什么。

15:53.369 --> 15:55.621
Gah...
嘎……

15:55.704 --> 15:58.624
See? Isn't he amazing?
看？他不是很了不起吗？

15:58.707 --> 16:00.501
Clear my mind.
理清我的思绪。

16:00.584 --> 16:05.214
Do nothing.
什么也不做。

16:14.390 --> 16:17.142
Ahh...
啊...

16:18.435 --> 16:19.395
I can't do it!
我做不到！

16:20.979 --> 16:24.233
You're not worthy of instruction
in the immobile arts.
你不值得教导
在不动的艺术中。

16:24.316 --> 16:27.653
Leave my presence.
离开我的存在。

16:27.736 --> 16:29.279
Couldn't I try...
我就不能尝试一下吗...

16:29.363 --> 16:30.989
Not a word.
一言不发。

16:31.073 --> 16:32.825
Dah...
呸……

16:32.908 --> 16:37.454
Stanley: I can't even
do nothing right.
斯坦利：我什至不能
什么都不做。

16:37.538 --> 16:38.664
Don't give up Stan-O.
不要放弃斯坦-O。

16:38.747 --> 16:40.290
We just need
to keep looking.
我们只需要
继续寻找。

16:47.631 --> 16:49.174
Oh, gentle hat.
哦，温柔的帽子。

16:49.258 --> 16:50.634
Symbol of employment.
就业的象征。

16:50.718 --> 16:53.095
Cornerstone of
my eternal happiness.
的基石
我永恒的幸福。

16:53.178 --> 16:59.601
I don thee now in preparation
for this work day.
我现在给你做准备
为了这个工作日。

16:59.685 --> 17:00.769
Whoo...
呼...

17:00.853 --> 17:04.440
You have no idea
how good this feels.
你不知道
这感觉多好啊。

17:04.523 --> 17:07.568
: No...
： 不...

17:07.651 --> 17:09.111
Hey, what's wrong, Stanley?
嘿，怎么了，斯坦利？

17:09.194 --> 17:11.029
You're not still upset
over that whole
你还没有不高兴
在整个

17:11.113 --> 17:13.532
"never accomplished anything
in life" thing, are you?
“从未完成任何事情
生活中的事情，你是吗？

17:13.615 --> 17:15.868
No...  .
不...  。

17:15.951 --> 17:17.703
Good, then why don't you
come with me to work.
很好，那你为什么不呢
跟我一起去上班吧。

17:17.786 --> 17:22.040
Maybe seeing me totally
fulfilled will cheer  you  up.
也许完全看到我
满足会让你高兴起来。

17:23.959 --> 17:26.545
There's me little
money maker.
有我一个小
赚钱机器。

17:26.628 --> 17:28.714
Mm, mm, mm...
嗯，嗯，嗯……

17:28.797 --> 17:31.258
Are you gonna make me
lots of money today?
你要让我
今天有很多钱吗？

17:31.341 --> 17:32.634
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

17:32.718 --> 17:35.429
Ooh, what'd I give
if only there were two of...
哦，我给了什么
要是有两个就好了……

17:35.512 --> 17:36.472
What?
什么？

17:36.555 --> 17:38.057
One, two?
一、二？

17:38.140 --> 17:39.224
There's two?
有两个吗？

17:39.308 --> 17:41.393
He looks like ya.
他看起来像你。

17:42.728 --> 17:44.396
He smells like ya.
他闻起来像你。

17:47.274 --> 17:48.233
He tastes like ya.
他的味道像你。

17:48.317 --> 17:51.236
Is he a hard worker
just like you?
他是一个勤奋的人吗
就像你一样？

17:51.320 --> 17:54.406
Um...
嗯...

17:54.490 --> 17:56.158
Duh... Eh...
呃……呃……

17:56.241 --> 17:57.117
Well, is he?
嗯，是吗？

17:57.201 --> 17:58.202
Please, please, please, please
拜托，拜托，拜托，拜托

17:58.285 --> 18:00.245
please, please, please,  please.
拜托，拜托，拜托，拜托。

18:00.329 --> 18:02.206
Yes, sir.
是的，先生。

18:04.166 --> 18:05.918
You got the job.
你得到了这份工作。

18:06.001 --> 18:08.712
Your job is to
take people's money
你的工作是
拿人家的钱

18:08.796 --> 18:10.380
and put it in here.
并把它放在这里。

18:10.464 --> 18:12.633
Whoa, can I touch it?
哇，我可以摸一下吗？

18:14.718 --> 18:17.638
Money?
钱？

18:17.721 --> 18:19.515
Burning?
燃烧？

18:29.691 --> 18:33.111
SpongeBob, who's
responsible for this?
海绵宝宝，谁是
对此负责？

18:33.195 --> 18:35.405
I...
我...

18:35.489 --> 18:37.407
...guess I am, Mr. Krabs.
...我猜是的，蟹老板。

18:37.491 --> 18:39.827
You're on probation, boy.
你正处于缓刑期，孩子。

18:39.910 --> 18:42.454
Well, Stanley,
thanks to you
嗯，斯坦利，
谢谢你

18:42.538 --> 18:43.914
I'm on probation.
我正在试用期。

18:43.997 --> 18:45.457
If you wanna keep this job
如果你想保住这份工作

18:45.541 --> 18:46.458
you're gonna have to...
你必须...

18:46.542 --> 18:47.584
Ooh...
哦...

18:47.668 --> 18:48.710
Customer at the port bow.
顾客在左舷鞠躬。

18:48.794 --> 18:49.711
Man your stations.
管理你的车站。

18:49.795 --> 18:52.422
Man your stations.
管理你的车站。

18:53.882 --> 18:56.677
Ready for duty.
准备值班了。

18:58.387 --> 18:59.471
My first customer.
我的第一个顾客。

18:59.555 --> 19:00.764
Hi, I'm Stanley.
嗨，我是斯坦利。

19:00.848 --> 19:04.560
Whoa... This is  so  exciting.
哇...这太令人兴奋了。

19:04.643 --> 19:06.019
Huh, I'd like a...
呵呵，我想要一个...

19:06.103 --> 19:07.646
Wait-Wait,
wait-wait, hold on.
等等等等，
等等等等，等等。

19:07.729 --> 19:10.649
I don't ever wanna
forget this moment.
我永远不想
忘记这一刻。

19:12.943 --> 19:14.570
That's gonna be a keeper.
那将成为一名守门员。

19:14.653 --> 19:16.446
Now let's do one
with funny hats.
现在我们来做一个
带着滑稽的帽子。

19:20.242 --> 19:25.247
Ooh, yeah, let's pretend
we're mad at each other.
哦，是的，我们假装
我们对彼此很生气。

19:28.834 --> 19:31.670
I can't wait to get
these developed.
我等不及想要得到
这些发展起来了。

19:35.883 --> 19:39.261
SpongeBob: I said
I'm ready, Stanley.
海绵宝宝：我说
我准备好了，斯坦利。

19:49.938 --> 19:52.733
SpongeBob, what's
the meaning of this?
海绵宝宝，什么
这是什么意思？

19:52.816 --> 19:54.234
Your station
looks horrible.
你的电台
看起来很可怕。

19:54.318 --> 19:56.528
Take some pride
in your work, boy.
有点自豪感
在你的工作中，孩子。

19:56.612 --> 19:58.780
Look at your cousin,
Stanley, for example.
看看你的表弟，
以斯坦利为例。

19:58.864 --> 20:00.032
Spiffin' up his work space
整理他的工作空间

20:00.115 --> 20:07.414
with meaningful photos
of the customers.
并附上有意义的照片
的客户。

20:08.498 --> 20:10.375
Um... sir?
嗯……先生？

20:10.459 --> 20:11.376
Yes, boy?
是的，男孩？

20:11.460 --> 20:12.878
About my cousin Stanley.
关于我的表弟斯坦利。

20:12.961 --> 20:15.797
Yes, yes, the one I hired
entirely on your recommendation.
是的，是的，就是我雇的那个
完全根据您的推荐。

20:15.881 --> 20:16.924
Hurry it up, boy.
快点吧，男孩。

20:17.007 --> 20:19.217
Uh, well...
Actually, sir?
呃，好吧...
事实上，先生？

20:19.301 --> 20:20.552
About those things I said?
关于我说的那些事？

20:20.636 --> 20:21.553
What?
什么？

20:21.637 --> 20:22.888
You didn't lie to me
你没有骗我

20:22.971 --> 20:26.099
just to help your cousin
get the job, did you?
只是为了帮助你的表弟
得到这份工作，是吗？

20:26.183 --> 20:26.808
No.
不。

20:26.892 --> 20:28.185
Well, good...
嗯，很好...

20:28.268 --> 20:29.728
Because there were plenty
of other relatives
因为有很多
其他亲戚的

20:29.811 --> 20:31.480
that got passed
over for the job.
已经通过了
结束工作了。

20:31.563 --> 20:33.398
Aye, 'tis true.
是的，这是真的。

20:33.482 --> 20:35.442
Whatever.
任何。

20:35.525 --> 20:38.862
I even turned down me own
three adorable nephews.
我什至拒绝了我自己
三个可爱的侄子。

20:38.946 --> 20:40.739
But
但

20:38.946 --> 20:40.739
Krabs.
螃蟹。

20:40.822 --> 20:41.782
They solve mysteries.
他们解开谜团。

20:43.492 --> 20:46.828
Now go solve the mystery of
why you didn't get the job.
现在就去解开谜底
为什么你没有得到这份工作。

20:49.581 --> 20:51.166
Stanley...
斯坦利...

20:51.250 --> 20:54.461
I cannot keep
covering for...  you!
我无法保留
为……你掩护！

20:57.673 --> 20:58.924
: No...
： 不...

20:59.007 --> 21:02.552
Not my spatula.
不是我的锅铲。

21:02.636 --> 21:04.638
My spatula.
我的锅铲。

21:04.721 --> 21:07.182
The thing I hold nearest
and dearest to my heart.
我拿着最近的东西
我最亲爱的。

21:07.265 --> 21:09.810
SpongeBob, what in the name
of Neptune has got...
海绵宝宝，叫什么名字
海王星有...

21:09.893 --> 21:13.522
Oh, you broke
your spatula.
哦，你坏了
你的抹刀。

21:13.605 --> 21:16.024
That's a shame.
太可惜了。

21:16.108 --> 21:18.443
I'll order another
one tomorrow, boy.
我再订一份
明天就有一个，孩子。

21:18.527 --> 21:20.779
No, no, no!
不，不，不！

21:20.862 --> 21:22.531
I  didn't break my spatula.
我没有弄坏抹刀。

21:22.614 --> 21:23.699
He  did.
他做到了。

21:23.782 --> 21:25.659
And I also didn't
burn your money.
而我也没有
烧掉你的钱。

21:25.742 --> 21:26.952
He did that, too.
他也这么做了。

21:27.035 --> 21:28.870
I have been covering for him
我一直在替他掩护

21:28.954 --> 21:32.541
because he can't
do anything right!
因为他不能
做任何事都正确！

21:35.669 --> 21:38.130
He's right  .
他是对的。

21:38.213 --> 21:42.592
I ruin everything I touch.
我毁掉了我接触到的一切。

21:42.676 --> 21:44.428
Wait a minute.
等一下。

21:44.511 --> 21:48.140
I know the perfect
job for you.
我知道完美
为你工作。

21:48.223 --> 21:50.726
Good luck at your new
job today, Cousin Stanley.
祝你新的好运
今天工作，斯坦利表弟。

21:50.809 --> 21:51.935
Thanks.
谢谢。

21:52.019 --> 21:54.396
I'll bet I'm even
better at this one.
我敢打赌我什至
更擅长这一点。

21:59.234 --> 22:02.320
Good morning,
Mr. SquarePants.
早上好，
方裤先生。

22:02.404 --> 22:04.489
Morning, boss.
早上好，老板。

22:04.573 --> 22:06.658
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

22:06.742 --> 22:09.286
That fool Krabs,
letting the blood relative
蟹蟹那个傻瓜，
让血亲

22:09.369 --> 22:11.288
of his best worker...
他最好的工人...

22:18.211 --> 22:21.548
Well, that's the end of me.
好吧，我的事就这样结束了。

22:21.631 --> 22:23.550
Sorry, boss.
对不起，老板。

对不起，老板。